oming follow up\, Brut\, arrives in Fall 2026. His novella\, ATTABOY\, was 
 
published as an Audible Original. Sam has 2 comedy specials: Waiting For De
 
ath to Claim Us & The Toad's Morale. He also has a travel show\, Wide World
 
\, on YouTube. Door Time: 6:30pm (front bar opens @ 5:30pm). Show Time: 7:3
 
