SUMMARY:Haymakers for Hope - Hope NYC XIV
LOCATION:Manhattan Center Hammerstein Ballroom\, Chelsea-Hudson Yards
DESCRIPTION:Haymakers for Hope presents the 14th annual Hope NYC\, taking p
 
lace on Thursday\, November 5\, 2026 at NYCs renowned Hammerstein Ballroom.
 
 After 4 months of training at boxing gyms across the city\, 32 courageous 
 
men & women will step into the ring for the first time to help knockout can
 
cer. Approximately 1\,800 attendees are expected to attend the gala style e
 
vent\, which will feature 16 bouts\, seated dinner\, silent auction\, drawi
 
ng & more. For more information regarding event sponsorship opportunities &
 
 table purchase please contact mark@haymakersforhope.org. About H4H: Establ
 
ished in 2010\, H4Hs mission is to knockout cancer the only way we know how
 
\, by literally fighting for a cure. We give everyday men & women the oppor
 
tunity to fight back against this terrible disease by training for\, & comp
 
eting in charity boxing events to help raise money & awareness. Thanks to o
 
ur supporters\, H4H has raised more than $42 million for cancer research\, 
 
care\, awareness & survivorship to date. Tickets & info: https://www.ticket
 
master.com/haymakers-for-hope-hope-nyc-xiv-new-york-new-york-11-05-2026/eve
 
nt/00006507BD13C132
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/haymakers-for-hope-hope-nyc-xiv-new-york-n
 
ew-york-11-05-2026/event/00006507BD13C132
